  "plan": {
    "goal": "Quantify competitive inhibition of CYP3A4-mediated UDPGA conjugation: report apparent Km, inhibited velocity, percent inhibition and run-condition IC50.",
    "rationale": "CYP3A4 conjugates UDPGA with Km = 1508.3 µM at substrate [S] = 4057.5 µM. A competitive inhibitor (Ki = 238.2 µM) is present at [I] = 396.2 µM. Under competitive inhibition, apparent Km = Km(1+[I]/Ki), fractional activity = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]), and run-condition IC50 = Ki(1+[S]/Km) (Cheng–Prusoff). Vmax = 3.9749 µmol/min gives the inhibited velocity.",
